:: Bus Comply

<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
You can feel their eyes on you before you even move. With nowhere to go, you hook your fingers under your _top.name and slowly <<pullup>> it, baring your <<undertop>>.
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	You keep your mouth shut and stare hard at your lap.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	Your face burns as you try not to look at any of them.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	"There. Happy now?" you mutter.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	"Enjoy the view and be quick about it, darling," you say under your breath.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You lift your chin as if the whole thing were your choice.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Get your laugh and be done with it," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You look at them as if they are something stuck to your shoe.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $player.gender_appearance is "m">>
	"Don't be shy," says the <<person1>><<person>> as <<he>> reaches out and pinches your right nipple.
<<elseif $player.perceived_breastsize is 0>>
	"You call those pathetic things breasts?" says the <<person1>><<person>> as <<he>> reaches out and pinches your right nipple.
	<<insecurity "breasts_small" 10>><<ginsecurity "breasts_small">>
<<elseif $player.perceived_breastsize lte 5>>
	"You call those little things breasts?" says the <<person1>><<person>> as <<he>> reaches out and pinches your right nipple.
	<<insecurity "breasts_small" 5>><<ginsecurity "breasts_small">>
<<elseif $player.perceived_breastsize lte 7>>
	"I knew you had nice boobs," says the <<person1>><<person>> as <<he>> reaches out and squeezes your right breast.
	<<insecurity "breasts_big" 5>><<ginsecurity "breasts_big">>
<<else>>
